    "features": "<p><strong>AKA:</strong> Card Sharp, Gambler</p><p>The hustler wants your money, and they’ve honed their gameplaying skills into a precision tool to get it. Whether they’re a card counter, a pool shark, or just an all-around cheater, it takes a sharp eye and a healthy dose of skepticism to avoid losing big when they at the table.</p><p><strong>Favored Stunts:</strong> Cast Out, Class Clown, Patter, With a Flourish</p><p><strong>Talents:</strong> Misdirection (Novice), Party Animal (Expert)</p><p><strong>Equipment:</strong> Cash, Loaded Dice, Playing Cards, Sports Car</p>",
